Subject: Share original frontend pointer conversion and options event production
Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Share exact feDPD normalized-coordinate conversion, integer viewport margins,
and OptionsScene position-before-action30 event construction. Console callers
retain genuine Wii DPDData, connection/validity, angle and backend branches.
Native desktop routing is an explicit policy over retained rendered frames;
no Wii class ID, DPD validity, speaker or rumble service is synthesized.

